<p id="A3.SS1.p4.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS1.p4.5.1" class="ltx_text">For fixed <math id="A3.SS1.p4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X=x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X=x</annotation></semantics></math>, the Gaussian Poincaré inequality implies</span></p>